# Auto commit and push

When a task produces project file changes, commit them and `git push` to `origin` on the current branch. Do not wait for a separate commit or upload request.

- Use English commit messages, one or two sentences, focused on why
- Never force-push, never amend a pushed commit, never skip hooks, never update git config
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials, keys)
- If there is nothing to commit, skip
